OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain arriving by    
OL,6,Fmid-morning. The rain may be heavy at  
OL,7,Ftimes, but some drier interludes are   
OL,8,Fpossible during the afternoon before   
OL,9,Ffurther rain moves in. Very windy,     
OL,10,Fespecially over the Peak District and  
OL,11,Falong the coast.                       
OL,13,CTonight:FThe bulk of the rain clears   
OL,14,Fovernight, with the wind easing,       
OL,15,Fhowever cloud lingers with showers to  
OL,16,Ffollow. Dry with clear skies by dawn   
OL,17,Fallowing temperatures to drop.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
