OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright and sunny start to    
OL,6,Fthe day, with a light breeze. Cloudy   
OL,7,Fperiods with the wind strengthening    
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon, possibly one or  
OL,9,Ftwo showers also forming.              
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy 
OL,12,Fwith cloudy periods on Monday,         
OL,13,Fheaviest rain likely to remain over    
OL,14,Fhigh ground. Wet and windy start to    
OL,15,FTuesday, drier later. Cloudy and wet   
OL,16,Fstart to Wednesday, clearing later.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
